  "description": "Three wing-blades in the air where the weapon throws one, fanned the way they leave the hand. The stat adds bounces, and a spine that bounces more is a spine you see in more places at once. Polish: each blade now sits on an ink rounded-rect of its own, drawn in the relic's own pixels rather than scaled with the blade, so the three separate from each other and from the panel at 1× instead of merging into one pale lozenge; on top of each, a dark strip along the bone-spine side and a thicker frost strip along the cutting edge give the blade a back and an edge without touching the projectile document.",
